Boundary notes:
  network-detection-response = vendor-neutral network-layer detection (IDS/IPS/NSM/NDR), visibility,
  forensics, NAC, and micro-segmentation. It does NOT own SIEM/SOAR correlation (siem-soar-
  investigation), host-side sensors (endpoint-detection-response), firewall/ACL rulebase audits
  (acl-rule-analysis), or the device configuration of SPAN/TAP/802.1X (multi-vendor-network-ops).
  The network-security vendor skills (suricata, snort, zeek; cisco-ise, clearpass, fortinac;
  illumio, guardicore) are skipped/refer-only in this vault per the generic-only disposition; this
  umbrella names them as routing context only. Zero-trust is referenced as a concept in prose; the
  zero-trust-assessment skill is a planned (not-yet-adopted) vault skill, so no cross-ref link is
  added to avoid a dangling reference.

